        "vulnerable"
      ]
    },
    "icon": "icons/equipment/shield/targe-wooden-boss-steel-brown.webp",
    "values": [
      {
        "field": "aac",
        "from": {
          "into": "amount",
          "pattern": "dismounted\\s*character\\s*,?\\s*an\\s*auxiliary\\s*shield\\s*grants\\s*a\\s*\\+(\\d+)"
        }
      },
      {
        "field": "weight6.stone",
        "from": {
          "into": "amount",
          "pattern": "However\\s*it\\s*is\\s*carried[\\s\\S]{0,60}?encumbrance\\s*of\\s*(\\d+)\\s*stone"
        }
      }
    ],
    "note": "A shield form is a SHIELD, not a difference applied to one: it imports as an armor item of type shield, carrying the ordinary in-hand AC and encumbrance its own passage states. The conditions - which carry states grant AC, what denies it, what mounting changes - are the meta enums; the consumer corrects DOWN from the ordinary value, so the item must state one. No price: the JJ prints none."
  },
